Clear system journal logs:
sudo journalctl --rotate
sudo journalctl --vacuum-time=1s

1. Check USB device history
sudo journalctl -k | grep -i usb


2. Check pendrive insertion events
sudo journalctl -k | grep -i "new USB device"


3. Check pendrive removal events
sudo journalctl -k | grep -i "USB disconnect"


4. Check recent USB events
sudo dmesg | grep -i usb


5. Check history with date and time
sudo journalctl -k | grep -Ei "usb|disconnect"